WEBVTT

00:20:59.038 --> 00:21:03.204
anxiety and marital problems and
undermines our sense of control

00:21:03.204 --> 00:21:05.913
and confidence. If you haven't
lost your job,

00:21:06.121 --> 00:21:08.079
you still may be feeling job insecurity,

00:21:08.496 --> 00:21:11.496
which has been linked to negative mental
and physical health outcomes.

00:21:12.204 --> 00:21:16.621
There's even evidence that economic
insecurity reduces our pain tolerance.

00:21:17.288 --> 00:21:20.121
But just as chaos doesn't mean
we've lost all control,

00:21:20.454 --> 00:21:24.121
a moment of huge upheaval like this one
doesn't mean everything is lost.

00:21:29.204 --> 00:21:33.579
Recessions can shape careers in ways that
are profound and profoundly surprising,